%F A364629 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(n+5*k+1,6*k+1) * binomial(3*k,k) / (2*k+1).
%F A364629 D-finite with recurrence 2*n*(2*n+1)*a(n) -(7*n+2)*(5*n-3)*a(n-1) +4*(-41*n^2+194*n-210)*a(n-2) +5*(83*n-225)*(n-4)*a(n-3) +20*(-28*n^2+223*n-441)*a(n-4) +4*(154*n^2-1468*n+3465)*a(n-5) +4*(-98*n^2+1094*n-3003)*a(n-6) +4*(34*n^2-436*n+1365)*a(n-7) -10*(n-6)*(2*n-17)*a(n-8)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A364629 (PARI) a(n) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(n+5*k+1, 6*k+1)*binomial(3*k, k)/(2*k+1));
